Subject: [PATCH] Customer app: Orders and Loyalty tabs for the dedicated
 (no-table) app

Bottom tabs in direct mode: Menu, Cart, Orders, Loyalty, Account. Orders lists every order
placed with the phone number; Loyalty shows tier, rank, rewards and totals; Account is
profile-only. Table (dine-in) app tabs unchanged. Browser checks added.

